<main id="top">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Business &amp; Process Automation</p>
        <h1>Processes that <b>run themselves</b>, so your team can run the business.</h1>
        <p class="lede">e-Xpert redesigns how work moves through your company. We remove manual steps, connect the systems you already use, and automate the routine, so growth doesn't depend on adding headcount.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#services">Explore services</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#about">Our story</a>
        </div>
      </div>
