  <section class="block" id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p>
          <h2>We find the problem, solve it, automate it, and grow with you.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">E-Xpert Consultants Limited is a business and process automation firm based in Dhaka. Every engagement follows the same loop as our logo: understand the business, fix what holds it back, take the manual work out, and keep it growing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cycle">
        <div class="cycle-art">
          <svg class="inf" viewBox="0 0 560 330" role="img" aria-label="The e-Xpert loop: Analyze, Solve, Automate, Grow">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="inf-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
                <stop offset="0" class="ig1"/><stop offset=".5" class="ig2"/><stop offset="1" class="ig1"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <filter id="inf-glow" x="-50%" y="-50%" width="200%" height="200%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6"/></filter>
              <radialGradient id="inf-halo"><stop offset="0" class="ih1"/><stop offset="1" class="ih2"/></radialGradient>
            </defs>
            <circle class="inf-bg" cx="280" cy="165" r="150" fill="url(#inf-halo)"/>
            <path class="inf-track" d="M280 165 C 220 67, 82 67, 66 165 C 82 263, 220 263, 280 165 C 340 67, 478 67, 494 165 C 478 263, 340 263, 280 165 Z"/>
            <path class="inf-rail" d="M280 165 C 220 67, 82 67, 66 165 C 82 263, 220 263, 280 165 C 340 67, 478 67, 494 165 C 478 263, 340 263, 280 165 Z"/>
            <path class="inf-t inf-t3" d="M280 165 C 220 67, 82 67, 66 165 C 82 263, 220 263, 280 165 C 340 67, 478 67, 494 165 C 478 263, 340 263, 280 165 Z"/>
            <path class="inf-t inf-t2" d="M280 165 C 220 67, 82 67, 66 165 C 82 263, 220 263, 280 165 C 340 67, 478 67, 494 165 C 478 263, 340 263, 280 165 Z"/>
            <path class="inf-t inf-glow" filter="url(#inf-glow)" d="M280 165 C 220 67, 82 67, 66 165 C 82 263, 220 263, 280 165 C 340 67, 478 67, 494 165 C 478 263, 340 263, 280 165 Z"/>
            <path class="inf-t inf-t1" d="M280 165 C 220 67, 82 67, 66 165 C 82 263, 220 263, 280 165 C 340 67, 478 67, 494 165 C 478 263, 340 263, 280 165 Z"/>
            <path id="inf-path" d="M280 165 C 220 67, 82 67, 66 165 C 82 263, 220 263, 280 165 C 340 67, 478 67, 494 165 C 478 263, 340 263, 280 165 Z" fill="none" stroke="none"/>
            <circle class="inf-eye" cx="122" cy="165" r="14"/>
            <circle class="inf-eye-ring" cx="122" cy="165" r="14"/>
            <g id="inf-sparks"></g>
            <g id="inf-marks"></g>
            <g id="inf-runner"><circle class="inf-run-halo" r="20"/><circle class="inf-run" r="9"/></g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <ol class="stages" id="stages">
          <li class="on"><span class="sn">01</span><div><h3>Analyze</h3><p>We study your workflows, data and teams to find the real problem, not only the symptoms.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="sn">02</span><div><h3>Solve</h3><p>We design the fix: a cleaner process, the right tools, and clear ownership for every step.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="sn">03</span><div><h3>Automate</h3><p>We build and roll out automations so routine work runs without manual effort or errors.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="sn">04</span><div><h3>Grow</h3><p>We measure results and keep improving, so the business scales without adding cost.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="expertise">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Major fields</p>
          <h2>Industries where we deliver.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">Each sector has its own workflows, regulations and peak seasons. We bring ready process templates from every one of them, so projects start further ahead.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fields">
        <article class="field f-travel" style="--c:var(--blue)">
          <span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path class="trail" d="M4 42 C 10 38, 14 36, 18 33"/><g class="plane"><path d="M8 24 40 9 31 39 24 29zM24 29 40 9"/></g></svg></span>
          <h3>TravelTech</h3>
          <p>Booking engines, channel managers, reservations and supplier payouts.</p>
          <div class="proc"><span class="proc-k">Process we automate</span><div class="proc-row"><div class="pt"><span class="pf"></span><span class="pdot"></span></div><ol><li>Search</li><li>Book</li><li>Pay</li><li>Check-in</li></ol></div></div>
        </article>
        <article class="field f-fin" style="--c:var(--blue)">
          <span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M8 40h32"/><rect class="b1" x="11" y="26" width="6" height="14" rx="1.5"/><rect class="b2" x="21" y="18" width="6" height="22" rx="1.5"/><rect class="b3" x="31" y="10" width="6" height="30" rx="1.5"/></svg></span>
