          <p>Payment flows, KYC onboarding, reconciliation and settlement.</p>
          <div class="proc"><span class="proc-k">Process we automate</span><div class="proc-row"><div class="pt"><span class="pf"></span><span class="pdot"></span></div><ol><li>KYC</li><li>Pay</li><li>Hold</li><li>Settle</li></ol></div></div>
        </article>
        <article class="field f-agro" style="--c:var(--blue)">
          <span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M10 40h28"/><g class="sprout"><path d="M24 40V22"/><path d="M24 28c-8 0-12-5-12-12 8 0 12 5 12 12z"/><path d="M24 24c0-7 4-11 12-11 0 7-4 11-12 11z"/></g></svg></span>
          <h3>Agro</h3>
