              <path class="base" d="M20 122H270"/>
              <rect class="col" x="34" y="92" width="36" height="30" rx="6" fill="#B6C8E2" style="--dl:0s"/>
              <rect class="col" x="94" y="74" width="36" height="48" rx="6" fill="#7E9CC6" style="--dl:.2s"/>
              <rect class="col" x="154" y="54" width="36" height="68" rx="6" fill="#4673AD" style="--dl:.4s"/>
              <rect class="col" x="214" y="30" width="36" height="92" rx="6" fill="#0B4A93" style="--dl:.6s"/>
              <path class="trend" pathLength="100" d="M52 84 L112 66 L172 46 L232 22" style="--dl:.9s"/>
              <g class="q"><text x="52" y="137">Q1</text><text x="112" y="137">Q2</text><text x="172" y="137">Q3</text><text x="232" y="137">Q4</text></g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Branding and PR</h3>
          <p>Brand identity, messaging, launch campaigns and media relations that make your business recognised and trusted.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Identity</span><span class="tag">Content</span><span class="tag">Media relations</span></div>
        </article>

        <article class="svc" style="--c:var(--c6)">
          <div class="svc-viz">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 280 140" role="img" aria-label="Sample automation gauge">
              <text class="vt" x="0" y="12">Process automation</text>
              <path class="gtrk" d="M18 118 A66 66 0 0 1 150 118"/>
              <path class="gval" pathLength="100" d="M18 118 A66 66 0 0 1 150 118"/>
              <line class="needle" x1="84" y1="118" x2="84" y2="66"/>
              <circle class="hub" cx="84" cy="118" r="6"/>
              <text class="vbig" x="84" y="100">88%</text>
              <text class="vl" x="176" y="58">Manual work</text>
              <rect class="trk2" x="176" y="64" width="98" height="10" rx="5"/><rect class="shrink" x="176" y="64" width="22" height="10" rx="5" fill="#9AA6B5"/>
              <text class="vl" x="176" y="100">Automated</text>
              <rect class="trk2" x="176" y="106" width="98" height="10" rx="5"/><rect class="sbar" x="176" y="106" width="86" height="10" rx="5" fill="#2E9BFF" style="--dl:.3s"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Automation and Excellence</h3>
          <p>Workflow automation, ERP and CRM integration, dashboards and continuous improvement, so operations run smoothly at scale.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Workflow automation</span><span class="tag">ERP &amp; CRM</span><span class="tag">Dashboards</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="svc-note">Charts show illustrative examples, not client data.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="block tint" id="products">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Our products</p>
          <h2>Platforms we built and run ourselves.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">Beyond client work, e-Xpert builds and runs its own digital products for payments, education and healthcare, using the same methods we bring to every client.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="products">
        <article class="product p-tb">
          <div class="p-logo"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="TrustBee" width="260" height="70"></div>
          <span class="p-tag">FinTech · Escrow</span>
          <h3>Safe payments between buyers and sellers</h3>
          <p>TrustBee holds a buyer's payment until the seller delivers. Sellers send a conditional payment request, funds are held through a Bangladesh Bank licensed payment gateway, and money is released once delivery is confirmed.</p>
          <ul class="p-feat">
            <li>Conditional payment requests</li>
            <li>Verified buyers and sellers</li>
            <li>Neutral dispute resolution</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost p-link" href="https://trustbee.com.bd/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit trustbee.com.bd <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11L11 5M6 5h5v5"/></svg></a>
        </article>
        <article class="product p-ch">
          <div class="p-logo"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Chaatro.com" width="200" height="43"></div>
          <span class="p-tag">EdTech · Mentoring marketplace</span>
          <h3>Find the right mentor for any goal</h3>
          <p>Chaatro.com is a mentoring marketplace that connects students across Bangladesh with vetted mentors for admission tests, school subjects, skills and career guidance. Students compare mentors, book live sessions and learn from home, starting with its leading cadet college admission programme.</p>
          <ul class="p-feat">
            <li>Verified mentor profiles to browse and compare</li>
            <li>One-to-one, small-group and batch sessions</li>
            <li>Live classes, bootcamps, ebooks and course bundles</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost p-link" href="https://chaatro.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit chaatro.com <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11L11 5M6 5h5v5"/></svg></a>
        </article>
        <article class="product p-db">
          <div class="db-main">
            <div class="db-logo"><span class="db-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="11" fill="#1584F7"/><path d="M11 12.5c3-1.6 6.2-1.6 9 .3 2.8-1.9 6-1.9 9-.3v15c-3-1.6-6.2-1.6-9 .3-2.8-1.9-6-1.9-9-.3z" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M20 12.8v15.3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M15.5 17v5M13 19.5h5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span class="db-word">Doctors<b>Book</b></span></div>
            <div class="db-tags"><span class="p-tag">HealthTech · Practice management</span><span class="db-new">New</span></div>
            <h3>Everything a doctor needs to run a practice</h3>
            <p>DoctorsBook gives doctors and chambers one system for appointments, prescriptions, patient records and payments, plus a branded website on their own domain. e-Xpert sets it up and manages it end to end, so doctors can focus on patients.</p>
            <ul class="db-steps">
              <li><b>1</b>Free demo</li>
              <li><b>2</b>We set up your site, domain and payments</li>
              <li><b>3</b>We train your staff and manage it for you</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn btn-primary p-link" href="#contact" data-topic="DoctorsBook for doctors">Request a free demo <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11L11 5M6 5h5v5"/></svg></a>
          </div>
          <ul class="db-feat"><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4M8 14h3"/></svg></span><div><b>Online appointments</b><span>Patients choose a chamber, date and time, pay in advance and get a serial number.</span></div></li><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l3 3v15H6z"/><path d="M9 9h3a2 2 0 0 1 0 4H9V9zM9 13v4M12 13l3 4"/></svg></span><div><b>Digital prescriptions</b><span>Bangla or English, with medicine and test lists. Print or send as PDF.</span></div></li><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M5 20c0-3.9 3.1-6.5 7-6.5s7 2.6 7 6.5"/><path d="M17 4h4M19 2v4"/></svg></span><div><b>Patient records</b><span>Visit history, reports and past prescriptions in one profile.</span></div></li><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20V9l8-5 8 5v11"/><path d="M9 20v-5h6v5M12 8v4M10 10h4"/></svg></span><div><b>Chambers &amp; schedules</b><span>Multiple chambers, fees, serial limits and leave days.</span></div></li><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18M7 6.5h.01M10 6.5h.01"/></svg></span><div><b>Doctor’s own website</b><span>A branded site on the doctor’s own domain with degrees, fees and reviews.</span></div></li><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="13" rx="3"/><path d="M3 10h18M7 15h4"/></svg></span><div><b>Online payments</b><span>bKash, Nagad, cards and bank, paid straight to the doctor’s account.</span></div></li><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/><path d="M8 10h8M8 13h5"/></svg></span><div><b>SMS &amp; reminders</b><span>Booking confirmations, visit reminders and follow-ups.</span></div></li><li><span class="db-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"/></svg></span><div><b>Dashboard &amp; reports</b><span>Income, patient flow and appointments at a glance.</span></div></li></ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="leadership">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p>
          <h2>The people behind e-Xpert.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">A small leadership team that stays close to every project, combining operations, strategy and technology.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="leaders">
        <article class="leader">
          <div class="l-top"><img class="l-av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Benozir Ahmed" width="80" height="80"><div><h3>Benozir Ahmed</h3><span class="l-role">Chairman &amp; COO</span></div></div>
          <p>Benozir chairs the board and runs e-Xpert’s day-to-day operations, from how project teams are formed to how delivery is tracked and measured. Under this leadership, every engagement follows the same Analyze, Solve, Automate, Grow method and is held to clear targets.</p>
          <a class="l-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/benozirahmed/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn profile <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11L11 5M6 5h5v5"/></svg></a>
        </article>
        <article class="leader">
          <div class="l-top"><img class="l-av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Sabuj Mandal Ovi" width="80" height="80"><div><h3>Sabuj Mandal Ovi</h3><span class="l-role">Managing Director &amp; CEO</span></div></div>
          <p>Sabuj sets e-Xpert’s strategy, leads client partnerships and oversees the company’s own platforms, TrustBee and Chaatro.com. Sabuj also serves as CEO of MyTravaly Bangladesh, bringing hands-on experience of building travel-tech operations, partner networks and payment flows.</p>
          <a class="l-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sobuj-k-mondal/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn profile <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11L11 5M6 5h5v5"/></svg></a>
        </article>
        <article class="leader">
          <div class="l-top"><img class="l-av" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Naim Ul Hassan" width="80" height="80"><div><h3>Naim Ul Hassan</h3><span class="l-role">Director &amp; CTO</span></div></div>
          <p>Naim leads technology at e-Xpert: product architecture, engineering and the automation stack behind client projects. Naim’s team builds and maintains the company’s own platforms, including the TrustBee escrow system and the Chaatro.com mentoring marketplace.</p>
          <a class="l-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/naim-ul-hassan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn profile <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11L11 5M6 5h5v5"/></svg></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block tint" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap contact">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.3rem);margin-top:14px">Tell us which process slows you down.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:.97rem">A free first consultation covers your current workflow and where automation would pay back fastest.</p>
        <ul class="details">
          <li><span class="k">Email</span><span class="v" id="v-email">care@e-xpertconsultants.com</span><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="v-email">Copy</button></li>
          <li><span class="k">Phone</span><span class="v" id="v-phone">+880 1332-092905</span><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="v-phone">Copy</button></li>
          <li><span class="k">Office</span><span class="v" id="v-addr">House 998 (1B), Road 9A, Avenue 11, Mirpur DOHS, Dhaka-1216, Bangladesh</span><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="v-addr">Copy</button></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <form id="enquiry" novalidate>
        <div class="row2">
          <label for="f-name">Your name<input id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
          <label for="f-company">Company<input id="f-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization"></label>
        </div>
        <div class="row2">
          <label for="f-email">Email<input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
          <label for="f-phone">Phone<input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label>
        </div>
        <label for="f-topic">What do you need help with?
          <select id="f-topic" name="topic">
            <option>Market Research and Business Analysis</option>
            <option>Marketing, Sales and Growth</option>
            <option>Technical Product Development</option>
            <option>Project Management</option>
            <option>Branding and PR</option>
            <option>Automation and Excellence</option>
            <option>DoctorsBook for doctors</option>
            <option>Not sure yet</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label for="f-msg">Message<textarea id="f-msg" name="message" placeholder="Briefly describe the process or problem"></textarea></label>
        <div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send enquiry</button></div>
        <p class="formnote" id="formnote" hidden></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

